{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14542","headline":"汉宫人入道 · 戴叔伦","name":"汉宫人入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧白发出宫门，羽服星冠道意存。\n霄汉九重辞凤阙，云山何处访桃源。\n瑶池醉月劳仙梦，玉辇乘春却帝恩。\n回首吹箫天上伴，上阳花落共谁言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}